      "x": 760,
      "y": 0.0,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 325.0,
      "text": "Azure Virtual Network Manager \u2014 AVNM-Demo (governs both hubs)\n\nConnectivity Configs (HubAndSpoke, Deployed):\n\u2022 production-hubspokemesh \u2192 hub anm-vnet-0 | trusted-hub1 + nontrusted-hub1\n\u2022 development-hubspokemesh \u2192 hub anm-vnet-16 | trusted-hub2 + nontrusted-hub2\n\nConnectivity Config (Mesh, Deployed):\n\u2022 global-backup-mesh \u2192 global-backup-networkgroup (cross-hub DR mesh)\n\nSecurity Admin Config 'secadminrule' (Deployed): 4 rule collections \u2014 see bottom panel",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "id": "el_4",
