    {
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1432.5,
      "width": 2180,
      "height": 195.0,
      "text": "AVNM Security Admin Rules (config: secadminrule, 4 rule collections \u2014 admin rules always evaluated BEFORE and override NSG rules)\n\nsecadminrulecollall \u2192 applies to ALL 4 groups | rule no-internet (priority 1000, Deny, Outbound *) \u2014 baseline deny-internet-egress for every group\nsecadminrulecoll-production \u2192 nontrusted-hub1-networkgroup | rule allowwithinprod (AlwaysAllow) \u2014 overrides deny within Hub1 non-trusted\nsecadminrulecoll-development \u2192 nontrusted-hub2-networkgroup | rule allowwithindev (AlwaysAllow) \u2014 overrides deny within Hub2 non-trusted\nsecadminrulecoll-trusted \u2192 trusted-hub1 + trusted-hub2 | rules allowtrustedmesh-in/out (AlwaysAllow, wildcard *) \u2014 AlwaysAllow supersedes any NSG, both hubs",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "id": "el_98",
      "containerId": "el_97",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    }
